    # m 2ekc "Otherwise, it'd be like you're trying to distract yourself because you feel awkward having them with you."
    m 2ekc "De lo contrario, sería como si intentaras distraerte porque te sientes incómod[end_letter_gender] de tener a esa persona contigo."

